<ul>
<li>Renal impairment：CrCl <strong class="ex-n">40–59 mL/min</strong> 不建議 &gt;600 mg；CrCl <strong class="ex-n">20–39 mL/min</strong> 起始劑量減 <strong class="ex-n">50%</strong>、最高 400 mg；CrCl &lt;20 mL/min 小心使用（無明確建議）。Severe hepatic impairment（total bilirubin &gt;3–10 倍 ULN）減量 <strong class="ex-n">25%</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.3561</span></li>
<li>Most common AEs：edema、nausea、vomiting、muscle cramps、myalgias、diarrhea、bone pain、fatigue、abdominal pain；較少見但嚴重：severe fluid retention（pericardial effusion、pulmonary edema、pleural effusions、ascites）、hematologic toxicity、congestive heart failure、liver failure、hemorrhage。<span class="ex-ref">p.3561</span></li>
<li>Cutaneous AEs（曾報告）：periorbital edema、dyspigmentation、morbilliform eruption、pityriasis rosea–like eruption、AGEP、psoriasis exacerbation、DRESS、pseudoporphyria、mycosis fungoides–like eruption、acute neutrophilic dermatosis、erythroderma、SJS、perforating folliculitis、urticaria。<span class="ex-ref">p.3561</span></li>
<li>Pregnancy category D（rodent 致畸、上市後有 congenital anomalies 報告）；乳汁可測得，哺乳嬰兒最多可接受母親劑量的 <strong class="ex-n">10%</strong> → 不建議哺乳。<span class="ex-ref">p.3561</span></li>
<li>Drug interactions：CYP3A4 inhibitors/inducers 影響濃度；imatinib 本身是 CYP3A4 moderate inhibitor、CYP2D6 weak inhibitor。<span class="ex-ref">p.3561</span></li>
</ul>
