</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="hdac-inhibitors">
<h2>5. Histone Deacetylase Inhibitors（HDAC 抑制劑）</h2>
<ul>
<li>Histone acetyltransferases（HATs）把 histone tails 上 lysine 乙醯化 → 中和正電荷 → chromatin 放鬆、transcription factor 較易接近 promoter；HDACs 造成 underacetylated state → transcriptional silencing。<span class="ex-ref">p.3576</span></li>
<li>癌細胞中 histone deacetylation 與 proapoptotic genes 及分化相關基因的下調有關；HATs/HDACs 也調控 nonhistone proteins（p53、NF-κB、E2F、HIF-1α）。<span class="ex-ref">p.3576</span></li>
<li>確切機轉未明；HDAC inhibitors 被認為藉恢復正常乙醯化而誘發 differentiation、cell-cycle arrest、apoptosis。<span class="ex-ref">p.3576</span></li>
<li>FDA 核准 4 種：<strong>vorinostat、romidepsin → CTCL</strong>；romidepsin、belinostat → PTCL；panobinostat → multiple myeloma。<span class="ex-ref">p.3575–3576</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Drug</th><th scope="col">Approval／效果</th><th scope="col">Dose</th><th scope="col">Key adverse effects／interactions</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Vorinostat（oral）</td><td><strong class="ex-n">2006</strong>：CTCL，在 2 種 systemic therapies 期間或之後 persistent、recurrent 或 progressive；heavily pretreated 病人 ORR <strong class="ex-n">24%–30%</strong>，pruritus 改善 <strong class="ex-n">32%–45%</strong>；通常視為 beyond second-line。抑制 HDAC1、2、3、6。<span class="ex-ref">p.3577</span></td><td><strong class="ex-n">400 mg</strong> daily with food<span class="ex-ref">p.3577</span></td><td>≥20%：fatigue、diarrhea、nausea、dysgeusia、thrombocytopenia、anorexia、weight loss；alopecia <strong class="ex-n">18.6%</strong>；嚴重：pulmonary embolism、SCC、anemia。與其他 HDAC inhibitors（如 valproic acid）併用曾有 GI bleeding 與 severe thrombocytopenia；與 coumarin 併用 PT/INR 延長。Pregnancy category D。<span class="ex-ref">p.3577</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>Romidepsin（IV）</td><td><strong class="ex-n">2009</strong>：CTCL，已接受至少 1 種 systemic therapy；ORR <strong class="ex-n">34%</strong>（advanced stage IIB 以上 <strong class="ex-n">38%</strong>），CR <strong class="ex-n">5.6%–7%</strong>；2011 擴及 PTCL。<span class="ex-ref">p.3578</span></td><td><strong class="ex-n">14 mg/m²</strong> over 4 hours，day 1、8、15 of 28-day cycle<span class="ex-ref">p.3578</span></td><td>Nausea、asthenia/fatigue、thrombocytopenia、vomiting、diarrhea、ECG T-wave changes；最常見嚴重 AE 是 infection；congenital long QT、用 QT-prolonging 藥或心血管病史者考慮心血管監測。<span class="ex-ref">p.3578</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>Belinostat（IV）</td><td><strong class="ex-n">2014</strong>：relapsed/refractory PTCL；ORR <strong class="ex-n">25.8%</strong>，CR <strong class="ex-n">10.8%</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.3578</span></td><td><strong class="ex-n">1000 mg/m²</strong> IV day 1–5 of 21-day cycle<span class="ex-ref">p.3579</span></td><td>主要經 UGT1A1 代謝 → 避免 strong UGT1A1 inhibitors；pregnancy category D。<span class="ex-ref">p.3578–3579</span></td></tr>
